            "name": "change"
          }
        ],
        "rows": [
          [
            "changed",
            "pubrel prepare drives pub 0.4 as well as 0.1 to 0.3."
          ],
          [
            "fixed",
            "release.json's tag must have a Section 9.1 tag's shape (<domain>-<name>-MM-YYYY: 3-6 letters, six letters, a month 01-12, a four-digit year): every command refuses another, so check fails the pull request that brings one instead of the first prepare, where pub refused it"
          ],
          [
            "added",
            "release.yml takes runs-on, the runner its job runs on (GitHub's ubuntu-latest by default), so a private repository can release on a self-hosted runner scale set; a runner without Rust gets the stable toolchain to install pubrel, and an unreachable cache no longer fails the job"
          ],
          [
            "internal",
            "Update other crates the supply-chain audits cover"
          ]
        ]
      },
